  "html": "<p><a href=\"/writing/dall-e-2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">I wrote about DALL-E</a> the other day. </p><p>Thought it would be fun to do an ongoing series of emails that shows you what the AI comes up with. </p><p>Let’s have some fun.</p><p>✌️</p><p><strong>Prompt: </strong>pixel picture of a guy listening to music with headphones on with sunglasses and a stubbly face and medium brown hair </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/8e00fad78132307c18d75919.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/7b14f54b4415dcb694820e90.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt: </strong>cool looking animal cute animal listening to music with headphones on</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/a7bca08f5f68382752512c77.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/9da9fcf2f2ef9d0d72006cda.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt:</strong> Joshua Voydik, film noir </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/492382b146608a1166fa05e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/babb2267cdf1933c5f0428d4.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt:</strong> NFT art in the style of Beeple's AR/VR \"everydays\" </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/63c594d4d1c460ae3f5dff3d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/7bee714e380d196c2754f2e2.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt:</strong> Award-winning 8k ultra real photograph of a skateboarding gorilla looking at the camera</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/b5187b3a953fcf4d048d3732.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/30a8e0e1f708898a4415c459.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt:</strong> ornate sketch of a person thinking in the style of Leonardo da Vinci</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/03333e2090d68e5333138b6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/42d451a7008c12d98b0abff8.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt:</strong> an expressive oil painting of a cat, depicted as an explosion of a nebula</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/0c29f40b2e43b7e8d273562e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/d9c65c7a0034fcd2256b9b73.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt</strong>: human looking into the distance pondering life and thinking, reflective, beautiful </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/ab247d1f95d7e3c40d17fdc6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/fab52ffa32fc87096e2e5fb1.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p><strong>Prompt:</strong> a human larger than godzilla fighting godzilla in new york city from the perspective of an aerial helicopter </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a href=\"/writing/5007d74f4e4c298eca1cb3b2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"/writing/ee86a4d21f52bcbd3a0bded9.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p>If you like my newsletter, please forward this email or share it. </p><p></p>",
